# Unmasking the Threat: Detecting Cloaking Attacks in Facial Recognition

Xavier Merino

Computer Engineering and Sciences

Florida Institute of Technology

Melbourne, FL, USA

xmerino2012@fit.edu

Pei Zhou

Computer Engineering and Sciences

